## 2026-06-27 (cont. 8)
_Live prices now auto-refresh: fetchLive() runs every REFRESH_MS (default 180000 = 3 min, overridable via window.DRIP_REFRESH_MS) plus a 30s ticker that updates a relative label. Status line now reads "live · 13/13 · refreshed HH:MM (Xm ago)". Skips fetching on a hidden tab and catches up immediately when the tab regains focus if stale. Verified headless with a 5s override: 3 refresh rounds (39 Finnhub calls), label updates, 0 errors. Committed + pushed; verified earlier that live data works on the deployed randomstringofwords.com/investments/._

